# Repo-wide line-ending policy. Prevents accidental LF<->CRLF churn
# (e.g. a Windows editor re-saving every file as CRLF).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows batch must stay CRLF — double-click execution depends on it (see CLAUDE.md).
# Treat as binary so git NEVER touches the line endings, in any checkout/export path.
*.cmd -text
*.bat -text
